coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder exit-node delete [flags] <name|id>

  Delete an exit node

  Aliases: rm

OPTIONS:
  -O, --org string, $CODER_ORGANIZATION
          Select which organization (uuid or name) to use.

  -y, --yes bool
          Bypass confirmation prompts.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
